{"root":"dendam","ipa":"/dendam/","core":"怨恨，记恨，报复","pos":["名词","形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/dendam/","zh":"怨恨；报复心理","phrases":[{"t":"rasa dendam","zh":"怨恨情绪"},{"t":"simpan dendam","zh":"记恨，怀恨在心"},{"t":"balas dendam","zh":"报仇，复仇"}],"examples":[{"t":"Janganlah menyimpan dendam terhadap orang lain.","zh":"不要对别人怀恨在心。"},{"t":"Dia masih menyimpan dendam atas kejadian itu.","zh":"他还在为那件事记恨。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"dendam","ipa":"/dendam/","zh":"怨恨的，心怀仇恨的","phrase":{"t":"hati dendam","zh":"怀恨的心"},"example":{"t":"Sikapnya yang dendam membuat orang menjauhinya.","zh":"他那记恨的态度让人对他避而远之。"}},{"w":"mendendam","ipa":"/mənˈdendam/","zh":"心怀怨恨，企图报复","phrase":{"t":"terus mendendam","zh":"一直记恨"},"example":{"t":"Sudahlah, jangan terus mendendam.","zh":"算了吧，别再记恨了。"}},{"w":"pendendam","ipa":"/pənˈdendam/","zh":"记仇的人，心胸狭窄的人","phrase":{"t":"orang pendendam","zh":"记仇的人"},"example":{"t":"Jangan jadi orang pendendam yang susah memaafkan.","zh":"不要做一个很难原谅别人的记仇之人。"}},{"w":"dendaman","ipa":"/dendaman/","zh":"怨恨，积怨","phrase":{"t":"dendaman lama","zh":"长久的积怨"},"example":{"t":"Dendaman di hatinya akhirnya terobati.","zh":"他心中的积怨终于得到了解脱。"}},{"w":"terdendam","ipa":"/tərˈdendam/","zh":"被怀恨的，潜藏怨恨的","phrase":{"t":"kemarahan terdendam","zh":"潜藏的怒火"},"example":{"t":"Ada rasa kesal yang terdendam di dalam hatinya.","zh":"他心里潜藏着一种不满的情绪。"}}],"derSlugs":["dendam","mendendam","pendendam","dendaman","terdendam"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T02:17:33.983Z","src":"base"}